{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":59,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"93d9e09f-3ed7-4788-8836-d6b49fbeee4e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275915,"PostDateInt":1789020932000,"PostDate":"2026-09-10T14:15:32","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"BD Manager(J24250)","OrgId":3230487,"Org":"营销","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. Collect information on wind power projects and developers.\n收集风电项目及开发商相关信息。\n2. Regularly analyze market trends and policy changes, and submit trend reports.\n定期分析市场趋势及政策变动，提交趋势报告。\n3. Maintain and update the stakeholder database and communication logs.\n维护并更新利益相关方数据库及沟通记录。\n4. Manage and supervise the initiation and follow-up of technical and commercial workflows, ensuring effective collaboration across functional teams.\n管理并监督技术及商务工作流程的启动与跟进，确保跨职能团队高效协作。\n5. Lead the wind project bidding process, coordinating the team to prepare necessary documents and presentations.\n主导风电项目投标流程，协调团队准备所需文件及演示材料。\n6. Handle contract negotiations, ensuring the terms align with company interests.\n负责合同谈判工作，确保条款符合公司利益。\n7. Follow up on accounts receivable for existing and future projects, ensuring timely payment.\n跟进现有及未来项目的应收账款，确保款项及时到账。\n8. Assist the regional manager in developing annual sales plans and implementing detailed execution strategies.\n协助区域经理制定年度销售计划，并落实具体执行策略。","Require":"1. Bachelor’s degree or higher in mechanical, electrical engineering, or any other related engineering majors.\n机械工程、电气工程或其他相关工程专业本科及以上学历。\n2. At least 3 years of experience in the wind energy or renewable energy sector, with a comprehensive understanding of power systems; \n3年及以上风电或可再生能源行业工作经验，对电力系统有全面了解；\n3. Excellent market judgment, business development, and data analysis skills.\n具备出色的市场判断力、业务拓展能力及数据分析能力。\n4. Strong communication and coordination skills with both internal and external resources.\n具备较强的内外部资源沟通与协调能力。\n5. Able to work under pressure and accept frequent travel.\n能承受工作压力，接受频繁出差。\n6. English can be used as a working language.\n英文可作为工作语言。","ClassificationOne":"金风国际","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-10T14:15:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"ce13f51f-7409-430d-8175-5f7673b64513","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275865,"PostDateInt":1788500834000,"PostDate":"2026-09-04T13:47:14","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电力系统高级/主任工程师(J24208)","OrgId":1836849,"Org":"金风科技","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.研究不同行业用电特性，结合典型场景与客户痛点等，研究标准化解决方案并不断迭代优化，从新型电力系统视角为集团产品技术规划、发展提供建议和支撑，指导产品技术研发。\n2.利用平台开展源网荷储一体化、绿电直连等项目建模仿真分析，整合新能源发电、电网、负荷、储能各环节模型，结合用户需求设计并/离网系统架构，模拟系统在不同运行场景下的交互特性，评估系统经济性与安全性，支撑项目可研方案设计与投资决策。\n3.开展电力系统建模及仿真分析，协同研发部门完成系统稳态（潮流计算、网损分析、电压/频率调整等）、暂态（故障分析、暂态稳定计算、扰动响应模拟等）仿真分析计算。\n4. 组织协调、统筹电力系统技术落地，推动方案迭代优化。配合团队完成电力系统相关技术课题研究、项目申报及技术文档撰写，参与行业技术交流，跟踪新型电力系统领域前沿政策与技术动态，推动技术成果转化。","Require":"1.学历要求：硕士及以上学历，电力系统、电气工程、控制工程、电力电子与电力传动等相关专业，具备较扎实的专业理论基础。\n2.院校要求：毕业于985/211高校、国内知名电力院校或海外知名院校优先，具备良好的学术素养与学习能力，有相关领域科研项目或实习经历。\n3.专业要求：熟悉电力系统分析、新能源发电技术、电力电子变换等核心知识，掌握电力系统建模与仿真工具（PSCAD/EMTDC、PSASP、BPA等）的操作与应用。\n4.工作经验：具有3年及以上电力系统分析、新能源项目相关工作经历，曾独立负责或核心参与新能源电力系统建模、并/离网系统设计、源网荷储一体化仿真等相关工作者优先。\n5.其他要求：创新思维敏锐，能独立应对复杂技术难题，具备出色的跨团队协作与资源整合能力；能够独立完成技术任务，具备良好的英文读写能力，可阅读专业英文文献，有相关行业资格证书者优先。","ClassificationOne":"金风低碳设计研究院","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-04T13:47:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"c196059e-54e5-4022-aa00-e163f6d534c3","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275839,"PostDateInt":1788180866000,"PostDate":"2026-08-31T20:54:26","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"预应力研发工程师(J24199)","OrgId":2844061,"Org":"产品研发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责预应力产品的结构设计、材料选型及性能优化，制定完整技术方案，并利用有限元分析工具进行结构强度、刚度及疲劳寿命校核；\n2.主导预应力产品加工工艺设计与工艺改进，跟踪生产过程，及时发现并解决质量与技术问题，持续提升产品良率与制造效率；\n3.对接客户需求与项目技术规格，编制预应力施工方案及施工组织设计，赴现场提供技术交底、施工指导及质量问题处置支持；\n4.跟踪国内外预应力领域前沿技术动态，开展新材料、新工艺的预研与试验验证工作；\n5.撰写技术文档、专利及论文，参与技术标准/企业标准的编制与评审；\n6.配合完成项目投标技术支持、方案汇报及技术交流。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，相关专业；\n2.   3 年以上预应力或相关结构产品研发设计经验；\n3. 熟练掌握有限元分析软件，具备独立建模、施加载荷、后处理及结果判读能力；\n4.熟悉预应力钢材（预应力钢绞线、钢丝、螺纹钢筋等）及混凝土材料的力学性能与选型规范；","ClassificationOne":"天杉高科","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-31T20:54:26","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"acc5dd41-9210-427f-8fc8-c29b7e10aa62","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275603,"PostDateInt":1787561582000,"PostDate":"2026-08-24T16:53:02","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"仓储管理员(J24180)","OrgId":700167140,"Org":"原料采购及绿色认证管理部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["内蒙古自治区·兴安盟"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.燃料出入库及系统台账管理 \n负责秸秆、生物质颗粒燃料出入库全流程作业，严格核验磅单、批次、数量、包装完整性；按燃料批次及时在 WMS 仓储系统完成收 / 发单据录入、库存动态更新，编制燃料收耗存日报、周报、月报，确保数据实时准确、全程可追溯；严格执行先进先出。\n2.燃料入厂验收、取样与质量管控 \n按金风生物质燃料检验标准，开展秸秆原料、生物质颗粒的入厂验收、外观核查、现场取样、送样登记；重点监控含水率、杂质、霉变、结块、粉尘等关键指标，对超标、不合规燃料按流程提报、拒收或隔离处置；做好样品留存、原始记录归档。\n3.在库 / 堆垛日常监测与养护（本岗位重点）\n落实料场分区、分批次堆存管理，区分散秸秆、打包秸秆、生物质颗粒，按规范控制堆高、垛距、通风间隙；执行堆垛定期测温巡检，重点防范秸秆自燃、颗粒受潮潮解、霉变；做好通风、排水、防雨覆盖、隔离防护，及时清理散落料、积尘，控制燃料损耗。\n4.盘点、账卡物核对与差异闭环 \n组织料场日巡盘点、月度全盘、交叉抽盘，核对系统台账、料卡、实物库存；梳理损耗、亏吨、混批、变质库存差异，形成盘点报告，及时上报并协同业务、质检、财务完成原因排查与整改闭环。\n5.料场标准化、5S 及现场文明管理 \n落实料场划线分区、标识标牌管理，不同来源 / 批次 / 品类燃料分开堆存，防止混料；保持料场通道畅通、场地硬化整洁，及时清理杂草、浮料、包装废弃物，规避引火风险；维护料场照明、排水、通风、测温等辅助设施，异常及时报修。\n6.料场安全、防火防爆与隐患排查（能源企业红线） \n严格执行金风科技安健环管理体系、生物质料场专项消防规范；落实料场火源管控、车辆入厂防火防护、防静电管理；每日巡查消防器材、监控、温度监测设施，排查堆垛自燃风险、电气隐患、通道堵塞等问题，第一时间上报并临时处置；配合三级安全教育、应急演练、动火作业监护，做好巡检记录。\n7.协同对接 \n协同燃料采购、质检、生产、物流、外运团队，配合料源调运、倒垛、清库、发料，及时反馈燃料品质异常、库存预警、堆垛安全风险。","Require":"1.大专及以上学历；有生物质电厂、秸秆 / 生物质颗粒料场、大宗农林原料仓储实操经验优先。\n2.熟悉秸秆、生物质成型颗粒物料特性，掌握燃料含水率管控、堆垛测温、自燃防控、防潮防霉、取样送检等基础技术要求，了解生物质燃料收储相关国标 / 行业规范。\n3.能独立操作 WMS 仓储系统、磅房数据登记，熟练使用 Office 做台账、统计报表；具备大宗散货 / 打包燃料盘点、差异分析实操能力。\n4.工作严谨、数据意识强，能适应露天料场作业、轮值巡检（含高温 / 雨季重点巡垛）；沟通顺畅，执行力强，具备跨班组协同能力。\n5.认同金风安健环体系，高度重视生物质料场防火、防自燃安全红线；熟悉现场作业风险，严格执行制度、规范记录、隐患及时上报。","ClassificationOne":"金风绿能化工","ClassificationTwo":"(社招)技能序列","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"大专","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-24T16:53:02","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"244e3c37-722c-4430-a4b3-b3f81201ad85","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275561,"PostDateInt":1787290596000,"PostDate":"2026-08-21T13:36:36","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"混塔健康监测工程师(J23987)","OrgId":2844061,"Org":"产品研发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责：\n1、负责风电混塔结构监测方案设计，完成测点规划、传感器选型及部署方案编制。\n2、负责与监测硬件厂家技术对接，制定安装及验收工艺要求。\n3、搭建监测数据判别、预警逻辑，开展监测数据收集与分析，输出塔架结构安全评估。\n4、开展行业竞品技术对标，推动监测体系迭代优化。\n5、编制技术规格书、方案、运维文档，支撑投标、技术评审及项目交付。\n6、负责风场现场监测系统调试、问题排查，对接业主解决现场技术问题。","Require":"任职要求：\n1、本科及以上学历，土木工程、结构工程、风电、机械、测控、自动化等相关专业；\n2、3-5年风电行业工作经验，熟悉风电混塔结构，了解风电行业标准、塔架监测规范，有风电安全监测、风电场智能运维经验者优先；\n3、熟悉风电结构监测传感器、采集终端等硬件设备者优先；\n4、具备方案撰写、竞品分析、现场问题排查能力，能独立输出技术方案；\n5、熟练使用办公、CAD制图、数据处理软件，具有一定的编程基础，有数据库搭建、数据处理经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"天杉高科","ClassificationTwo":"(社招)研发序列","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel