对处理：全面预测评估风电国央企大客户市场风险，制定并执行应对策略降低风险损失。","Require":"1. 学历背景：本科及以上学历，土木及机械相关专业为佳；\n2. 工作经验：要求具备丰富的销售和管理经验，特别是在大客户客户关系与管理、市场开拓等方面。3年以上的相关工作经验，具备一定大客户客户资源；\n3. 政策及市场洞察力：熟悉并对风电相关国家及敏锐的市场洞察力，能够准确把握市场动态和竞争态势，为公司的销售策略制定提供有力支持；\n4. 销售技能：指导相应营销团队营销策略，精通销售技巧，包括市场分析、客户关系建立和维护、商务谈判等；\n5. 战略思维：需要具备战略思维能力，能够参与公司整体战略规划，为区域销售业务的发展提供长远规划；\n6. 领导力和沟通技巧：要求具备卓越的领导力和沟通技巧，能够激励团队、协调关系，并与上级、下属、客户等各方进行有效沟通。","ClassificationOne":"天杉高科","ClassificationTwo":"(社招)营销协同序列","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-07T15:16:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"cd0bac31-1392-4bb4-a289-2b1182f86796","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275249,"PostDateInt":1784785695000,"PostDate":"2026-07-23T13:48:15","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电力系统主任工程师(J23835)","OrgId":100200,"Org":"研发中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 建模与仿真：\n负责PSS/E或DigSILENT PowerFactory 平台风电机组及风电场的电气建模，满足仿测一致性精度要求；\n建立风电场集电系统、变电站、无功补偿装置（如SVG、SVC）及外送线路的模型；\n制定方案并执行电力系统稳态、暂态、小信号稳定性和谐波分析等仿真研究。\n2. 并网问题处理：\n分析和解决风电场并网过程中遇到的技术难题，如弱电网适应性、低/高电压穿越、功率振荡、频率稳定性等问题；\n与国际电网公司技术人员、客户进行技术沟通，支持并网申请和验收工作。\n3. 技术支持与开发：\n支持项目前期电气设计预研、可行性研究，撰写并网符合性研究报告；\n跟踪和研究国内外风电并网的最新标准和技术发展趋势。","Require":"1、电力电子或电力系统方向，掌握电力系统运行或电控的基本知识，具有电力系统暂稳态分析和继电保护基础，掌握新能源设备/场站并网控制基本原理，有新能源电站可行性研究和接入系统设计项目经验更佳；熟悉电力系统基本原理、了解风机/风电场/新能源场站控制和运行特性；\n2、熟练使用电力系统仿真软件 (PowerFactory DigSilent、PSCAD 优先）；\n3、具备代码编写能力和基础优先（C，python ，frotran一种或多种）；\n4、有新能源并网经验（国际项目工作经验优先）；\n5、熟练的英语听说读写及交流能力，英语能作为工作语言；\n6、良好的团队协作及沟通协调能力。","ClassificationOne":"风电产业集团","ClassificationTwo":"(社招)研发序列","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-23T13:48:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"b2d25ba6-9dc6-478b-bbde-7f06b1e758a3","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275245,"PostDateInt":1784785472000,"PostDate":"2026-07-23T13:44:32","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"算法高级工程师（关键部件监测分析方向）(J23834)","OrgId":100200,"Org":"研发中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责风电机组关键部件（齿轮箱、主轴承、发电机、叶片、塔筒）的故障诊断算法与健康评估模型的开发。\n2. 基于振动、温度、转速、声发射等多源数据，开发时频域特征提取算法（如小波变换、经验模态分解、阶次跟踪等），实现早期微弱故障的识别。\n3. 结合机械传动系统动力学机理，开发融合物理模型与数据驱动的混合诊断算法，提升诊断准确率。\n4. 负责将算法封装为适配各平台（场级、边缘、控制系统）的组件，并实现集成和部署。\n5. 负责算法预警结果进行现场验证与标定，持续迭代优化算法模型。","Require":"1、机械工程（故障诊断方向）、测控技术与仪器、信号处理、计算机（机器学习方向）等相关专业，硕士及以上学历，博士优先。\n2、5年以上工业设备（风电、旋转机械、航空航天）故障诊断或状态监测算法经验。\n3、精通信号处理理论（傅里叶变换、小波分析、包络分析等）；熟悉机械传动系统原理，如齿轮箱、轴承的故障机理（如齿轮啮合频率、轴承特征频率计算）。\n4、精通Python，熟练使用PyTorch/TensorFlow。\n5、对数据敏感，具备扎实的数学统计基础；有较强的现场问题溯源能力。","ClassificationOne":"风电产业集团","ClassificationTwo":"(社招)研发序列","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-23T13:44:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"De